// Villagers of Vindomagos.
=== start
[flag ford_done] -> after
"You're from up the hill, aren't you? Brigodunon." They look you up and down. "Have you come about the ford? Somebody should."
* "Maybe." -> END
* "What about the ford?" -> ford

=== ford
"Germans. Sitting on it like hens on eggs. My brother tried to take a cart of salt across without paying, and they broke his arm in two places." They shake their head. "Sulicena says pay. Sulicena always says pay."
* "Sulicena's not wrong." -> END
* "I'll see what I can do." -> END

=== after
"The ford's open! I heard it was you." They grin. "Drink on me, next time you're through."
* "I'll hold you to that." -> END
